ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "Although the main purpose is to confirm and detect gene-environment interactions of lifestyle-related diseases, mainly of cancer, through the cohort analyses, it includes cross-sectional analyses on lifestyle factors, biomarkers, and genotypes, as well as confirmation/ screening of new biomarkers usable for early diagnosis of cancer. The endpoints are cancer diagnosis and death.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A17696755+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(obo:IAO_0000116 "cancer") ObjectSomeValuesFrom(coho:is_population_study_of obo:MONDO_0004992) coho:COHO_0000571)
