ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "The fourth cohort (Dental SCORE, n = 548) is a subset of a larger project, Heart SCORE, which is an ongoing cardiovascular disease study of 2,000 middle aged White and African Americans in the Pittsburgh region of Pennsylvania [17].") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9378791/fullTextXML") Annotation(obo:IAO_0000116 "cardiovascular disease") ObjectSomeValuesFrom(coho:is_population_study_of obo:MONDO_0004995) coho:COHO_0001312)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "Stage 1: Inclusion criteria for cases were (i) T2DM according to 1997 American Diabetes Association (ADA) criteria1 ; (ii) family history of diabetes in first degree relatives; (iii) BMI < 30 kg/m².") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fnature05616/MediaObjects/41586_2007_BFnature05616_MOESM286_ESM.pdf") Annotation(obo:IAO_0000116 "type 2 diabetes") ObjectSomeValuesFrom(coho:has_patients_with obo:MONDO_0005148) coho:COHO_0001313)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "Patients in the discovery set were adult, African American participants from the Diabetes Multi-omic Investigation of Drug Response (DIAMOND), a cohort study of patients with T2D from a health system serving southeast Michigan.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A37639712+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(obo:IAO_0000116 "type 2 diabetes") ObjectSomeValuesFrom(coho:has_patients_with obo:MONDO_0005148) coho:COHO_0001314)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "The primary objective of the DNHS was to examine how biological variation, stressful and traumatic life experiences, and environmental factors contribute to the prediction of psychopathology and behavior.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12975512/fullTextXML") Annotation(obo:IAO_0000116 "psychopathology") ObjectSomeValuesFrom(coho:is_population_study_of obo:MONDO_0002025) coho:COHO_0001315)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "The primary objective of the DNHS was to examine how biological variation, stressful and traumatic life experiences, and environmental factors contribute to the prediction of psychopathology and behavior.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12975512/fullTextXML") Annotation(obo:IAO_0000116 "post-traumatic stress disorder") ObjectSomeValuesFrom(coho:is_population_study_of obo:MONDO_0005146) coho:COHO_0001315)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "For the iCOGS genotyping stage, 4,330 women with a confirmed diagnosis of endometrial cancer and European ancestry were recruited via 11 studies in Western Europe, North America and Australia, collectively called the Endometrial Cancer Association Consortium (ECAC).") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4907351/fullTextXML") Annotation(obo:IAO_0000116 "endometrial cancer") ObjectSomeValuesFrom(coho:has_patients_with obo:MONDO_0011962) coho:COHO_0001316)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "The EDC study is a prospective cohort study of 933 participants with childhood-onset (aged <17 years) type 1 diabetes diagnosed at Children's Hospital of Pittsburgh from 1950 to 1980.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A22851572+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(obo:IAO_0000116 "type 1 diabetes") ObjectSomeValuesFrom(coho:has_patients_with obo:MONDO_0005147) coho:COHO_0001318)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "The common functional polymorphism rs2230199 (Arg80Gly) in the C3 gene, corresponding to the electrophoretic variants C3S (slow) and C3F (fast), was strongly associated with age-related macular degeneration in both the English group (603 cases and 350 controls, P=5.9x10(-5)) and the Scottish group (244 cases and 351 controls, P=5.0x10(-5)).") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A17634448+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(obo:IAO_0000116 "age-related macular degeneration") ObjectSomeValuesFrom(coho:has_patients_with obo:MONDO_0005150) coho:COHO_0001319)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "Thus, the Brazilian Longitudinal Study of Adult Health (in Portuguese, ‘Estudo Longitudinal de Saúde do Adulto’, ELSA-Brasil) aims to investigate the development of chronic diseases, primarily diabetes and cardiovascular diseases, over a long-term follow-up.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4339754/fullTextXML") Annotation(obo:IAO_0000116 "cardiovascular disease") ObjectSomeValuesFrom(coho:is_population_study_of obo:MONDO_0004995) coho:COHO_0001320)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "Thus, the Brazilian Longitudinal Study of Adult Health (in Portuguese, ‘Estudo Longitudinal de Saúde do Adulto’, ELSA-Brasil) aims to investigate the development of chronic diseases, primarily diabetes and cardiovascular diseases, over a long-term follow-up.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4339754/fullTextXML") Annotation(obo:IAO_0000116 "diabetes") ObjectSomeValuesFrom(coho:is_population_study_of obo:MONDO_0005015) coho:COHO_0001320)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "EMBLEM is a case control study of childhood Burkitt lymphoma (BL) designed to investigate risk factors of BL in malaria-endemic areas of Uganda, Tanzania, and Kenya.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://emblem.cancer.gov/") Annotation(obo:IAO_0000116 "Burkitt lymphoma") ObjectSomeValuesFrom(coho:has_patients_with obo:MONDO_0007243) coho:COHO_0001321)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "Essen-Heidelberg, Germany Histologically confirmed cutaneous melanoma cases (N = 1,218) were genotyped using the Illumina HumanCytoSNP-12v1-0_D arrays (San Diego, CA, USA).") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41588-020-0611-8/MediaObjects/41588_2020_611_MOESM1_ESM.pdf") Annotation(obo:IAO_0000116 "cutaneous melanoma") ObjectSomeValuesFrom(coho:has_patients_with obo:MONDO_0005012) coho:COHO_0001322)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "The French FARIVE study recruited patients with confirmed acute VTE, with controls recruited from hospital patients treated for non-VTE causes.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10247781/fullTextXML") Annotation(obo:IAO_0000116 "venous thromboembolism") ObjectSomeValuesFrom(coho:has_patients_with obo:MONDO_0005399) coho:COHO_0001323)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "All patients diagnosed with FMD (string-of-beads or focal stenosis in at least one vascular bed) based on computed tomography angiography, magnetic resonance angiography, and/or catheter-based angiography were eligible.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A32282921+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(obo:IAO_0000116 "fibromuscular dysplasia") ObjectSomeValuesFrom(coho:has_patients_with obo:MONDO_0006761) coho:COHO_0001324)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "The basic aim of the FT12 study design was to obtain information on individual, familial and school/neighborhood risks for substance use/abuse prior to the onset of regular tobacco and alcohol use and then track trajectories of use and abuse and their consequences into adulthood.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7108792/fullTextXML") Annotation(obo:IAO_0000116 "substance abuse") ObjectSomeValuesFrom(coho:is_population_study_of obo:MONDO_0002491) coho:COHO_0001327)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "FOCI seeks to expand our understanding of epithelial ovarian cancer through a coordinated and comprehensive approach.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://ftp.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/dbgap/studies/phs001133/phs001133.v1.p1/GapExchange_phs001133.v1.p1.xml") Annotation(obo:IAO_0000116 "epithelial ovarian cancer") ObjectSomeValuesFrom(coho:has_patients_with obo:MONDO_0005140) coho:COHO_0001329)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "A human cohort of MP patients, healthy subjects at genetic and/or environmental risk, and control subjects (N = 2500) has been established.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A30267149+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(obo:IAO_0000116 "major depressive disorder") ObjectSomeValuesFrom(coho:has_patients_with obo:MONDO_0002009) coho:COHO_0001330)
