ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "RADIANT is an umbrella term for three studies which sought to understand genetic risk for MDD and factors affecting response to treatment; this comprised of the Depression Network (DeNT) study (Farmer et al., 2004), the Depression Case-Control (DeCC) study (Cohen-Woods et al., 2009) and the Genome-Based Therapeutic Drugs for Depression (GENDEP) study (Uher et al., 2009).") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC6191533/fullTextXML") Annotation(obo:IAO_0000116 "major depressive disorder") ObjectSomeValuesFrom(coho:has_patients_with obo:MONDO_0002009) coho:COHO_0002307)
